    "case_for": "Optical lattice clocks are a mature and repeatedly demonstrated advance in precision measurement. They have transformed timekeeping and opened new tests of fundamental physics. Katori and Ye made complementary, identifiable contributions to establishing the technique, giving this case a strong connection between a consequential discovery and the people credited with it.",
